# Quora Question Similarity — Machine Learning

## Objective
Identify whether two Quora questions are duplicates or semantically similar.

## Analytical Workflow
**Text cleaning → feature engineering → similarity representation → model training → evaluation → deployment**

## Techniques Covered
- Text preprocessing
- TF-IDF and similarity-based features
- Cosine similarity
- Classification/model-selection concepts
- Potential Siamese-network approaches

## Portfolio Note
This repository is positioned as an NLP/ML project; the README describes the intended methodology without claiming model results that are not documented in the project files.

## Tech Stack
**Python | NLP | TF-IDF | Cosine Similarity | Scikit-learn | Machine Learning**